OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F332A1785320347
OL,3,CShamed funeral director gave bereaved
OL,4,Cmum animal ashes after miscarriage
OL,6,FWarning: Article contains distressing
OL,7,Fdetails
OL,9,FA bereaved mother has told of her
OL,10,F"torture" after disgraced funeral
OL,11,Fdirector Robert Bush gave her the
OL,12,Fashes of an animal instead of those of
OL,13,Fher unborn baby.
OL,15,FLucy Ness organised a cremation
OL,16,Fthrough Legacy Independent Funeral
OL,17,FDirectors after she miscarried two
OL,18,Fdays before her 12-week scan in April
OL,19,F2021.
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G1/8
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BYorks News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,333,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33202
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F332A1785320347
OL,3,CShamed funeral director gave bereaved
OL,4,Cmum animal ashes after miscarriage
OL,6,FShe had no reason to doubt that the
OL,7,Furn she was given contained her
OL,8,Fchild's ashes until news broke three
OL,9,Fyears later that Bush was under
OL,10,Finvestigation.
OL,12,FMs Ness filled in a form for concerned
OL,13,FLegacy customers and was then
OL,14,Fcontacted by investigators.
OL,16,F"Within a week I got a phone call from
OL,17,Fthe police saying they needed to speak
OL,18,Fto me about the ashes," she said.
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G2/8
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BYorks News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,333,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33203
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F332A1785320347
OL,3,CShamed funeral director gave bereaved
OL,4,Cmum animal ashes after miscarriage
OL,6,F"I didn't think these ashes would not
OL,7,Fbe mine. I just thought they'd come
OL,8,Fround just to speak."
OL,10,FFollowing tests, Ms Ness was later
OL,11,Ftold the ashes were not even human.
OL,13,F"I've recently been informed by the
OL,14,Fpolice that the ashes he actually gave
OL,15,Fme in the baby urn were, in fact,
OL,16,Fanimals, bones and ashes," she said.
OL,18,F"They've had an expert in to check,
OL,19,Fand they've managed to open it and
OL,20,Frealised these are animal, animal
OL,21,Fbones.
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G3/8
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BYorks News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,333,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33204
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F332A1785320347
OL,3,CShamed funeral director gave bereaved
OL,4,Cmum animal ashes after miscarriage
OL,6,F"I was distraught, absolutely
OL,7,Fdistraught.
OL,9,F"It's hard to put into words, because
OL,10,Fat, at the time, I didn't believe them.
OL,12,F"I didn't want to believe them."
OL,14,FMs Ness said the police investigation
OL,15,Frevealed her baby's cremation had
OL,16,Ftaken place two days after she was
OL,17,Fgiven the ashes.
OL,19,F"I don't know what he's done with my
OL,20,Fbaby's ashes," she said.
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G4/8
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BYorks News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,333,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33205
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F332A1785320347
OL,3,CShamed funeral director gave bereaved
OL,4,Cmum animal ashes after miscarriage
OL,6,F"I'd like to think that he'd handle
OL,7,Fthem with care and given it to
OL,8,Fsomebody, but I, there's always that,
OL,9,Fyou, you never know.
OL,11,F"He could have just put them in the
OL,12,Fbin or flushed them on the toilet,
OL,13,Fwhich is horrible.
OL,15,F"But you just never know what's come
OL,16,Fthrough that man's head.
OL,18,F"He had a duty of care with my baby,
OL,19,Fhe promised me he'd look after my
OL,20,Fchild, and.
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G5/8
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BYorks News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,333,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33206
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F332A1785320347
OL,3,CShamed funeral director gave bereaved
OL,4,Cmum animal ashes after miscarriage
OL,6,F"Nobody knows where these ashes are."
OL,8,FThirty-five bodies, along with ashes,
OL,9,Fwere found at Legacy's premises after
OL,10,Fpolice were contacted in March 2024.
OL,12,FRobert Bush is being sentenced at Hull
OL,13,FCrown Court after admitting 67
OL,14,Fcharges, including preventing a lawful
OL,15,Fburial and fraud.
OL,17,FA plaque has been installed at the
OL,18,FLegacy Memorial Gardens in Hull in
OL,19,Fmemory of Ms Ness's unborn baby.
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G6/8
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BYorks News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,333,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33207
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F332A1785320347
OL,3,CShamed funeral director gave bereaved
OL,4,Cmum animal ashes after miscarriage
OL,6,FThe garden serves as a resting place
OL,7,Ffor more than 100 sets of ashes which
OL,8,Fwere recovered from the Legacy
OL,9,Fpremises.
OL,11,FMs Ness said she regularly visits the
OL,12,Fsite on her due date and at Christmas
OL,13,Fin the hope that her baby's remains
OL,14,Fmay have been buried there.
OL,16,F"It's nice to think that wherever the
OL,17,Fashes are, if he's given them to
OL,18,Fsomebody else, that they are here,"
OL,19,Fshe said.
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G7/8
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BYorks News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,333,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33208
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F332A1785320347
OL,3,CShamed funeral director gave bereaved
OL,4,Cmum animal ashes after miscarriage
OL,6,F"It's nice and peaceful...it's a place
OL,7,Fthat everyone can just sort of escape
OL,8,Fto, just for a bit of peace and to
OL,9,Fremember things that could have been."
OL,11,FShe added: "I'm never going to know
OL,12,Fthe truth, I like to think that
OL,13,Fthey're here."
OL,15,FMs Ness has called on the government
OL,16,Fto start putting regulation into the
OL,17,Ffuneral industry in place.
OL,19,F"They're not really taking any of it
OL,20,Fseriously at the moment, which I think
OL,21,Fthey need (to)."
OL,26,@}D@Kpm}D@Npn
